{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01154",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 7.39,
      "duration_seconds": 6.47,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.61,
      "end_seconds": 12.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 14.1,
      "end_seconds": 19.49,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Doctor, I'm just here to help with the details."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 20.0,
      "end_seconds": 22.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Absolutely, come and sit beside them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 24.19,
      "end_seconds": 28.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "she's been having a sore stiff knee, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.15,
      "end_seconds": 30.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.27,
      "end_seconds": 42.94,
      "duration_seconds": 11.67,
      "text": "I'm, I'm not sure when it began, to be honest some weeks ago, but I can't say how many"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.67,
      "end_seconds": 46.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Does anything help it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.44,
      "end_seconds": 51.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I get some relief from a heat pad"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.42,
      "end_seconds": 55.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Is it a lot or only a little?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.88,
      "end_seconds": 58.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.43,
      "end_seconds": 61.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.77,
      "end_seconds": 78.9,
      "duration_seconds": 16.13,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get the knee giving way a little as well. As for knee giving way a little, a eight out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.23,
      "end_seconds": 83.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "any stiffness in the morning as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.76,
      "end_seconds": 85.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Yes, actually."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.71,
      "end_seconds": 89.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.24,
      "end_seconds": 98.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "Yes, arthritis in my knees. I've never really been one for hospitals. I have eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 99.59,
      "end_seconds": 107.43,
      "duration_seconds": 7.84,
      "text": "I see, go ahead. Right, so eczema is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.0,
      "end_seconds": 122.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.53,
      "end_seconds": 138.7,
      "duration_seconds": 14.17,
      "text": "I used to drink heavily but I stopped four years ago. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.62,
      "end_seconds": 143.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.89,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.29,
      "end_seconds": 145.49,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "no, never"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.05,
      "end_seconds": 151.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.25,
      "end_seconds": 157.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Let me think, I take diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 158.69,
      "end_seconds": 169.46,
      "duration_seconds": 10.77,
      "text": "mm, doctor, I think the last prescription for the diclofenac was 25 milligrams we changed it at the last visit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.45,
      "end_seconds": 175.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "Okay. Have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 176.67,
      "end_seconds": 184.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.21,
      "text": "oh, um, no, I left it at home. Hydrocortisone cream, when needed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.66,
      "end_seconds": 190.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "okay, did you get locked knee or redness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.21,
      "end_seconds": 194.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.69,
      "text": "Ah, no, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.52,
      "end_seconds": 199.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "Did you get fever or fall?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.75,
      "end_seconds": 203.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.16,
      "text": "no fever or fall, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.62,
      "end_seconds": 206.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.04,
      "end_seconds": 211.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "yeah, no, that's all fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.99,
      "end_seconds": 217.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "Okay, anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 219.33,
      "end_seconds": 222.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.49,
      "text": "okay, so no, that's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.13,
      "end_seconds": 243.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.94,
      "end_seconds": 259.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Alright, bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.67,
      "end_seconds": 288.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.01,
      "text": "Okay: pulse is 78 beats a minute, pressure 123 over 73, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, respiratory rate 17."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.68,
      "end_seconds": 292.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Now I'm gonna do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.36,
      "end_seconds": 296.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.06,
      "end_seconds": 317.01,
      "duration_seconds": 7.95,
      "text": "The joint line is tender, there is a bit of crunching, and the knee bends to to ninety degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.07,
      "end_seconds": 320.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "yeah, uh, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.19,
      "end_seconds": 337.33,
      "duration_seconds": 12.14,
      "text": "Right, you can sit up now. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I can't pin this down yet. We're looking at knee osteoarthritis flare or a a meniscal tear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 337.93,
      "end_seconds": 339.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Is this permanent?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 341.59,
      "end_seconds": 350.28,
      "duration_seconds": 8.69,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like knee osteoarthritis flare, but I'd like to confirm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.12,
      "end_seconds": 399.61,
      "duration_seconds": 38.49,
      "text": "I want an X-ray of the knee done, that's for knee pain. For this, paracetamol, 1 gram, four times a day, two weeks. You take it by mouth. That's for knee pain. Strengthen the thigh muscles and lose a little weight if you can. I'll also refer you to physiotherapy. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'll want another look in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 401.42,
      "end_seconds": 404.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 406.13,
      "end_seconds": 410.81,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Uh, great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}